WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
All children dream of becoming adults as soon as possible.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:09.000
Visiting KidZania, you will see how sincerely and boldly they get immersed in our lives.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.600
KidZania is an adult world created specifically for kids. It looks and operates like a real city.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:23.600
Here, children try their hand at more than 100 exciting professions, acquire useful skills and unforgettable experiences.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:33.600
The idea to prepare children for adult life in a playful way, which is at the core of the KidZania concept, correlates with the global objectives of Royal Canin.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:44.800
Among those are the popularization of the veterinarian profession, actualization of the need for preventive visits to the veterinary clinic and education of a responsible attitude to pets.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:53.000
The veterinary clinic opening will teach children in an interactive way to take care of their pets’ health properly and consciously.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Different scenarios of activity in the veterinary clinic are developed for children aged four to fourteen years.
